---
title: "restart_policy (Docker Deployment Configuration)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_running: container started
    q_running --> q_exit: process exits
    q_running --> q_manual_stop: docker stop issued
    q_exit --> q_check_code: check exit code
    q_check_code --> q_restart: exit code != 0 (crash)
    q_check_code --> q_restart: exit code = 0 (clean exit)
    q_restart --> q_running: restart container
    q_manual_stop --> q_stopped: unless-stopped honored
    q_stopped --> [*]: container remains stopped

    note right of q_restart
        INV-001: unless-stopped restarts on any exit unless manually stopped
        INV-002: restart loop has no backoff by default in docker-compose v3.8
    end note

    note right of q_manual_stop
        INV-003: manual stop persists across docker daemon restarts
    end note
